    "q1": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "text": "Decided — brief amended 2026-09-22.\n\nExactly two terrain layers: Background below Foreground, fixed roles and order, no add / duplicate / delete / reorder. Only Foreground owns the land mask; subtracting it reveals Background. Rivers and lakes modify that same mask and create no layer. Object, path and text layers arrive later, reorderable above both.\n\nImport now asks which mode each time with neither preselected, and the preview is kept for comparison either way.",
      "w": 520,
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 2460
    }
